<title>USA: Applebee's completes restaurant purchase.</title>
<headline>Applebee's completes restaurant purchase.</headline>
<dateline>OVERLAND PARK, Kan. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applebee's International Inc said Monday it completed its planned acquisition of 11 Applebee's restaurants in the St. Louis area from its franchisee, Apple Partners LP.</p>
<p>The company said the deal also includes an unspecified number of restaurants under development. Applebee's also plans to continue the further development of the St. Louis market.</p>
<p>An Applebee's spokesman said the $36.1-million purchase price, first announced in February, was not adjusted.</p>
<p>The company develops, franchises and operates casual dining restaurants in 45 states and four countries.</p>
<p>Its shares closed up 1/8 Monday at 23-5/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
